	(text "PROG 3.0k = 1S, 1.5 MHz (table 7-1). ILIM 120k/100k = 1.59 A. TS 5.1k/30k + NTC (Battery sheet). CE pulled to +3V3 = charge off until firmware writes VREG. STAT LED and INT; QON open (internal pull-up). Charger I2C (IO1/IO2, ULP RTC I2C) pull-ups R54/R55 to +3V3" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 11.43 173.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "534e7ad9-3d3e-5360-af1b-7dcbe9c9896a"))
